  "id": "child-day-care",
  "term": "child day care",
  "definition": "Child day care is a non-parental care setting, such as kindergarten or another day-care institution, that children attend during the day. Entering child day care is described as a major transition in a child’s life and may also support development, for example by helping compensate for possible language difficulties.",
